<title>FRANCE: Audiopar will sell 2.1 pct in Canal Plus to Havas.</title>
<headline>Audiopar will sell 2.1 pct in Canal Plus to Havas.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audiopar, an investment company belonging to the UGC group, will sell its 2.1 percent stake in Canal Plus to Havas for 609 million francs, Havas finance director Nicolas Duhamel said.</p>
</text>
